<view class="page"><text class="eyebrow">HELLO, NEIGHBOR</text><view class="title">先认识一下。</view><view class="sub">一点点信息，找到更适合的约玩。</view><view class="card"><view class="field"><view class="label">家长昵称</view><input maxlength="20" value="{{nickname}}" data-key="nickname" bindinput="field" placeholder="给自己取个昵称"/></view><view class="field"><view class="label">孩子年龄（岁）</view><input type="number" value="{{age}}" data-key="age" bindinput="field"/></view><view class="sub">仅用于筛选年龄合适的活动。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="save">保存家庭资料</button></view><view class="notice">资料仅保存在当前设备。无需孩子真实姓名、照片、学校或住址。</view></view>
